## 1. Executive Summary & Persona Taxonomy

This specification defines the complete taxonomy of Customer Identity & Access Management (CIAM) personas for Euroclear's target architecture. Personas are structured across three primary operational domains: **External B2B Clients**, **Internal Workforce Operating in CIAM Context**, and **Non-Human / Channel System Personas**.

